<title>USA: AirNet to buy Data Air, add $15 mln revs.</title>
<headline>AirNet to buy Data Air, add $15 mln revs.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>AirNet Systems Inc said Tuesday that it has signed an agreement to acquire Data Air Courier Inc, a transporter of canceled checks, for $4 million.</p>
<p>AirNet said that the acquisition should add about $15 million to its revenue base, increasing its annual run rate above $100 million.&quot;</p>
<p>&quot;The acquisition of Data Air Courier should greatly enhance our competitive position for weekend services,&quot; said Jerry Mercer, chief executive officer, in a press release.</p>
</text>
